    "If this is off, the extension sees nothing in private windows. Content blockers stop blocking there, without any warning." : {
      "comment" : "A description of the private window option.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "オフにすると、プライベートウインドウではこの拡張機能は何も見えなくなります。コンテンツブロッカーは警告なしにそこでの遮断を止めます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If you continue, Skyscraper will connect anyway and stop asking about this server until you quit. Do this only for a server you set up yourself." : {
      "comment" : "The warning shown in the certificate dialog before the user is allowed past it.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "If you continue, Skyscraper will connect anyway and stop asking about this server until you quit. Do this only for a server you set up yourself."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "続行すると、Skyscraper はこのまま接続し、アプリを終了するまでこのサーバについては確認しなくなります。自分で立てたサーバの時だけにしてください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If you continue, this page will travel in the clear. Anyone between you and the server can read it, and change it on the way. Skyscraper will stop trying https for this server until you quit." : {
      "comment" : "The warning shown before the user is allowed to fall back to an unencrypted connection.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "If you continue, this page will travel in the clear. Anyone between you and the server can read it, and change it on the way. Skyscraper will stop trying https for this server until you quit."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "続行すると、このページはそのまま線の上を流れます。あなたとサーバの間に居る誰もが中身を読め、途中で書き換えることもできます。Skyscraper は、アプリを終了するまでこのサーバに https を試さなくなります。"
          }
        }
