            "value" : "タブ"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tabs you have not looked at for a while give up their contents and free the memory they were holding. They load again when you select them, with the scroll position and history intact. Anything typed into a form is lost." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tabs you have not looked at for a while give up their contents and free the memory they were holding. They load again when you select them, with the scroll position and history intact. Anything typed into a form is lost."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "しばらく見ていないタブは中身を手放し、抱えていたメモリを返します。選び直せば読み込み直され、スクロール位置と履歴はそのまま戻ります。フォームに打ち込んだ内容は失われます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tags such as utm_ and fbclid, which only report where you came from, are removed when a page is opened. The page itself is not changed. Copy Clean Link works either way." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "utm_ や fbclid など、どこから来たかを知らせるためだけの札を、ページを開く時に取り除きます。ページの中身は変わりません。「きれいなリンクをコピー」は、ここを切っても使えます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That file has no address, user name and password columns." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "That file has no address, user name and password columns."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "そのファイルにアドレス・利用者名・パスワードの列が見当たりません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That file has no bookmarks in it." : {
      "comment" : "Error message when a bookmark file is empty.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "That file has no bookmarks in it."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "そのファイルにブックマークが見当たりません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That file holds the passwords in plain text." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "That file holds the passwords in plain text."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "そのファイルにはパスワードが平文で入っています。"
