    "Theodore, the elevator attendant, takes requests typed into the Directory (⌘K): closing tabs, opening bookmarks, reopening closed tabs and working the current tab. Requests are understood on this Mac with Apple Intelligence and are never sent anywhere." : {
      "localizations" : {
